3. Restrictions. Without the prior written permission of the copyright
   holder, you may not copy, modify, adapt, translate, redistribute, sell,
   sublicense or publish the source code or the application, in whole or in
   part, nor create derivative works based on them.

4. Third-party components. Voxara includes third-party components
   (libraries and fonts). Each of them remains under its own license; see
   THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Nothing in this license limits the rights those
   licenses grant you over those components.

5. Scene model. The weights of the scene model used by Auto mode in debug
   builds were trained on TUT Acoustic Scenes 2017 (Tampere University of
   Technology), whose license allows only non-commercial and scientific
   research use. Those weights are not included in the official releases and
   may not be used for any commercial purpose.

6. No warranty. Voxara is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind,
   express or implied. Its sound levels and doses are estimates; Voxara is
